      "dialog": "CUT INTO THE ICE: A LINE OF PEAKS, AND PAST THE LAST OF THEM A SMALL LIGHT, PICKED OUT IN GOLD.\n\nUNDER IT, WORN NEARLY SMOOTH: IT WAS HERE BEFORE THE FIRST OF US. WE ONLY FOUND IT."
